WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.400
¿Qué deseas?

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.520
Such a warm greeting.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.560
Did I interrupt something?

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.080
Robert, I don’t have all day.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.640
You need to come home.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.640
Your sister and

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.600
your stepmom are

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.680
already there.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.800
Why do I care?

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.280
Cause you're also a suspect,

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.080
Charlotte.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.040
What do you mean?

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.280
Your father…

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.320
He's in a coma.
